<title>USA: Guyana signed PL-480 pact for U.S. wheat - USDA.</title>
<headline>Guyana signed PL-480 pact for U.S. wheat - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guyana has signed a PL-480 agreement allowing sale of $9 million in U.S. wheat, the Agriculture Department said Wednesday.</p>
<p>About 50,000 tonnes of wheat could be sold under the pact.</p>
<p>Supply period was set for fiscal 1997, which ends Sept 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Purchase authorizations will be announced after USDA counter-signs the agreement. Sales would be made by U.S. traders on a competitive bid basis.</p>
</text>
